summary:
  The cut stays on while a device plays along with this computer.

history:
  A device takes the stream itself and nobody turns it down. With this
  computer ten decibels under it on one station and level with it on the
  next, the balance the listener set between the two is gone.

target:
  package/contents/ui/LoudLogic.js

find:
      if (f.casting !== false && f.local !== false) return 0;

replace:
      if (f.casting === null) return 0;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_loudlogic.qml::test_nothing_is_cut_while_a_device_plays_along
  and tests/qml/tst_loudness.qml::test_the_factor_stands_aside_while_a_device_plays_along.
  Line-neutral.
